  "description": "AGGREGATE ANALYSIS view. Set the time picker to the campaign window ($__range). Each bar chart puts scenario on the x-axis with one bar per protocol, aggregated across the repetitions in range (sustained phase only). Authoritative mean±std lives in results/summary_aggregated.csv — Grafana here is for exploration.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Aggregate analysis (sustained phase).** Set the time range to your campaign window. Bars = one value per protocol×scenario aggregated over that range. These are *exploratory* aggregates of the live remote-write stream; the authoritative mean±std for the thesis is `results/summary_aggregated.csv` (and per-phase detail in `results/summary_by_phase.csv`). Server CPU/mem (Caddy, Backend) is untagged in cAdvisor; it is aligned to each run by masking on k6's sustained-phase request rate. Latency bars show the dashboard's average of k6's pushed percentile snapshots, not exact per-run percentiles."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Throughput (req/s) — by scenario, grouped by protocol",
      "type": "barchart",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "auto",
        "xField": "scenario",
        "showValue": "auto",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "avg by (protocol, scenario) (avg_over_time((sum by (protocol, scenario) (rate(k6_reqs_total{phase=\"sustained\"}[1m])))[$__range:1m]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "labelsToFields",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "groupingToMatrix",
          "options": {
            "columnField": "protocol",
            "rowField": "scenario",
            "valueField": "Value"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
